  "message": "We’ve got four mappers that spot vendor patterns by payment type—cash, card, bank transfers, and everything else. Then a synthesizer pulls those together and flags missed bills or odd amounts. The receipt scanner hunts for orphaned or mislabeled receipt images, and the expense reconciler finds expense rows without matching receipts. If you just want a snapshot of what reports already exist, the progress_check can show you that. Let me know which you’d like to run or if you have any other questions.",
